abstract: >-
  atelier-profile-hiro is an independently maintained, unofficial third-party
  LaTeX publication profile for writing about HIRO2026 and Shinosawa Hiro. It
  provides three parallel title layouts, editorial and essay reading profiles,
  narrative blocks and cross-media bibliography rendering, and bundles the
  locked AtelierTeX 0.5.3 runtime required for single-repository compilation.
  The project is not affiliated with or operated by the event organizers.
